HOW-TO: INDEX LIFECYCLE MANAGEMENT FOR APEX INDICES

OVERVIEW
ILM automates the movement of index data through hot → warm → cold → delete phases based on age and size criteria. All Apex time-series indices must use ILM. Static indices (apex_customer_360, apex_security_acls) do not use ILM.

MANDATORY REQUIREMENTS (post PLAT-4610)
All ILM policies MUST be defined as JSON via the Elasticsearch API, NOT via Kibana UI.
All ILM policy JSON files MUST be version-controlled in ops-platform/elasticsearch/ilm-policies/.
Any change to an ILM policy requires a PR with 2 reviewer approvals.

TEMPLATE FOR NEW TIME-SERIES INDEX ILM POLICY:
PUT _ilm/policy/apex-<index-name>-policy
{
  "policy": {
    "phases": {
      "hot": {
        "min_age": "0ms",
        "actions": {
          "rollover": {"max_age": "7d", "max_primary_shard_size": "50gb"},
          "set_priority": {"priority": 100}
        }
      },
      "warm": {
        "min_age": "7d",
        "actions": {
          "shrink": {"number_of_shards": 1},
          "forcemerge": {"max_num_segments": 1},
          "set_priority": {"priority": 50},
          "allocate": {"require": {"_tier_preference": "data_warm,data_hot"}}
        }
      },
      "cold": {
        "min_age": "90d",
        "actions": {
          "searchable_snapshot": {"snapshot_repository": "apex-snapshots"},
          "set_priority": {"priority": 0}
        }
      },
      "delete": {
        "min_age": "<retention_period>",
        "actions": {"delete": {}}
      }
    }
  }
}

RETENTION PERIODS BY INDEX:
apex_financial_transactions: delete after 10 years (AML regulation)
apex_operational_telemetry: delete after 3 years
apex_customer_interactions: delete after 7 years (complaint regulation)
apex_pharma_batches: delete after 10 years (GxP compliance)
apex_it_knowledge_base: delete after 7 years
apex_security_acls: NO DELETE (permanent audit trail)

ILM HEALTH MONITORING (required per PLAT-4611):
Daily cron job checks for stuck ILM steps: /opt/apex/scripts/es/check-ilm-health.py
Alert: any index stuck in same ILM step > 24h → ServiceNow P3 ticket auto-created.
